    "title_amharic": "ድንግል ማርያምን ከመስደብ በንስሐ የተመለሱ ሁለት ወጣቶች በጥር 21 ቀን ዕጣንና ሌሎች ስጦታዎችን ይዘው መጡ።",
    "incipit": "ወነበሩ፡  ፪ ወራዙት፡ አረማውያን፡ ወይጸልኡ፡ ዝክረ፡ ስማ፡ ወይጸርፉ፡ ላዕሌሃ። ወያስቆርሩ፡ ድንግልናሃ፡ በኩሉ፡ ልቦሙ። ወነበሩ፡ ብዙኃ፡ መዋዕለ፡ ወኀልቁ፡ ንዋያቲሆሙ፡ ወውሉዶሙ፡ ወጥሪቶሙ፡ ወስእኑ፡ ዘይገብሩ። ወሖሩ፡ ኀበ፡ ቤተ፡ ክርስቲያና፡ ለእግዝእትነ፡ ድንግል፡ ማርያም፡ ወላዲተ፡ አምላክ፡ አመ፡ ፳ወ፩ ለወርኃ፡ ጥር። ወነሥኡ፡ ዕጣነ፡ ወመባአ፡ ወወሀቡ፡ ለቀሲስ፡ ወነገሩ፡ ጌጋዮሙ፡ ዘከመ፡ ጸረፉ፡ ላዕሌሃ። ወአእመሩ፡ ዘከመ፡ አጥፍአቶሙ፡ ወተናገረቶሙ፡ በገሃድ፡ ሑሩ፡ እንዘ፡ ትብል፡",
    "manuscript_count": 1,
    "most_read": false,
    "translations": [
      {
        "author": "Mehari Worku with Wendy Laura Belcher",
        "text": "<p>Two pagan youths hated the name of Mary. They spoke insultingly about her and despised her virginity with all their heart. They lived like this for a long time.</p>\n\n<p>Then, all their possessions, children, and savings came to an end.</p>\n\n<p>So, they went to the church of Our Lady Mary, the Virgin, the Mother of God, on the 21st of the month of Tir [January 7]. They took an offering and gave it to the priest. They also confessed their sin, how they had spoken insultingly about Our Lady Mary.</p>\n\n<p>[They came to confess because] they had come to understand that she was the one who had destroyed their livelihood.</p>\n\n<p>[After they confessed], she clearly told them, “Go! Don’t sin again! Don’t insult me again!”</p>\n\n<p>They rejoiced joyously [because their life] returned to the way it had been.</p>\n\n<p>They [later] died, at peace because of the prayers of Our Lady Mary, the Mother of God.</p>\n\n<p>May her prayers and blessings, and the mercy of her son, be with Kola Dǝngǝl forever and ever. Amen.</p>"
      }
    ]
