    "title_amharic": "የ16ኛው ክፍለ ዘመን ኢትዮጵያዊ ንጉሥ ልብነ ድንግል (ዳግማዊ ዳዊት) በድንግል ማርያም ተጎበኘ፤ የወደፊት ዕጣ ፈንታውም ተነገረው፤ ክፍል 6",
    "incipit": "ወአመ ፡  ዕሥራ ፡  ወአሚሩ ፡  ለወርኃ ፡  ሚያዚያ ፡  ሖረ ፡  ልብነ ፡  ድንግል ፡  ውስተ ፡  ቤተ ፡  ክርስቲያን ፡  ዘእግዝእትነ ፡  ማርያም ፡  ከመ ፡  ይስአል ፡  በህየ ፡  በእንቲአሁ ፡  ወበእንተ ፡  ሀገሩ ፡  ቅድስት።",
    "manuscript_count": 1,
    "most_read": false,
    "translations": [
      {
        "author": "Mehari Worku",
        "text": "<p>A miracle of Our Lady Mary, Holy Twofold Virgin, the Mother of God. May her prayer and blessings be with us forever and ever. Amen.</p>\n\n<p>On the twenty-first of Miyazya, Lebna Dengel went to Our Lady Mary’s church to beg for himself and for his holy nation.</p>\n\n<p>He entered the church and, with a racing mind and caught-up intellect, said, “My dear Lady, allow me to speak with you, my Lady, so that the archangel Ragu‘el might come as usual to tell me what is ordained to come upon me, whether good or bad.”</p>\n\n<p>Then, he returned to his palace and spent the entire night in sadness.</p>\n\n<p>At midnight, the archangel Ragu‘el came and appeared to Lebna Dengel in a dream. The archangel said, “Dear Lebna Dengel, listen to what I am going to tell you. Take to heart what I am going to say to you. For your father Na‘od’s beloved, the Mother of God, has sent me to you on this day [as usual].</p>\n\n<p>“In the later days the Roman foreigners’ children, Leo’s children, the apostates King Sayfa ‘Ar‘ed’s priests, will multiply in Gozzam. They are the ones whom Zara Yaq̣ob banished, for they say Mary and her son’s Cross do not deserve prostration.</p>\n\n<p>“They remained in Gozzam after Virgin Mary’s beloved, the righteous orthodox king Zara Yaqob, condemned them. They live all over Gozzam.</p>\n\n<p>“Listen also [to the following,] which I am going to tell you. First, there will be a fight between the priests of Shawa and Tegray. Some of Shawa’s priests, who are the righteous Takla Haymanot’s children, will say, “We are celebrating the former Sabbath [Saturday] like the Christian’s Sabbath [Sunday]. For the Synodos of Christ’s Apostle have commanded to honor both Sabbaths equally.</p>\n\n<p>“There will be those from Tegray’s priests—who are Ma‘eqaba ‘Egzi‘e’s children, born at the great place of ‘Aqa ‘Ita—who will also say [the same regarding the Sabbath].</p>\n\n<p>“Then, Dabra Libanos will be [re]consecrated for three days by the hands of a bishop named ‘E. King Ya’s children will be led captive by the hand of that king.</p>\n\n<p>“The people of Shawa will be exiled to Ca.</p>\n\n<p>“At that time, Dabra Maryam—which is called Ma and was built by Abba Yedla with bishop Muse, who is also named Abba Salama II, who came after Salama I, who is Frumentius, Ethiopia’s Illuminator—will be built first by the hand of that king.</p>\n\n<p>“Near to that church is where the Cross of Our Lady Mary’s son is hidden from the enemy.</p>\n\n<p>“Keep everything I have told you until I come and tell you about what will happen in the future when Our God’s Mother sends me.”</p>\n\n<p>Having said this, the angel Ragu‘el disappeared from his sight.</p>\n\n<p>Lebna Dengel became amazed by the power of Our Lady’s help through the angel Ragu‘el. He hoped for another visit from the angel Ragu‘el.</p>\n\n<p>May her prayer and blessings be with us forever and ever. Amen.</p>"
      }
    ]
