    "translations": [
      {
        "author": "Mehari Worku",
        "text": "<p>The miracle of Our Holy Lady Mary Two Fold Virgin the Mother of God. May her prayer and blessings be with us forever and ever. Amen.</p>\n\n<p>One day Archangel Ragu‘el came down from heaven and appeared in dreams to Ethiopia’s King Lǝbnä Dǝngǝl. The archangel said to Lǝbnä Dǝngǝl, “Dear Lǝbnä Dǝngǝl listen to what I am going to tell you. For I have promised you to tell you the rest [of the prophecy] as Our God Jesus’ mother Mary sent me to [do so].</p>\n\n<p>“During that time the king- who will be appointed according to Our Lady Mary’s will and through the faith of the Egyptian bishop who consecrates Däbrä Libanos at the time of religious controversy- will appoint a local ruler over Shäwa.</p>\n\n<p>After this, Uriel prayed for that king so that there will always be someone from King Ya’s descendants to rule over Shäwa.</p>\n\n<p>Like your father Na‘od’s church, which Na‘od called the Holy Church, in Yo town which was built in [honor of] Our Lady Mary’s nativity, King Ya builds great churches in Mänzǝh for Archangel Uriel, and in Tägulät and Wäggǝda for Gabriel the herald of Our Lord’s nativity.</p>\n\n<p>This is in accordance with Nao’d’s father Bä ‘ǝdä Maryam’s Mǝs‘alä Maryam church and Bä‘ǝdä Maryam’s father Zär‘a Ya‘ǝq̣ob’s churches in ‘Adäshäwa and Däbrä Mǝṭmaq̣.</p>\n\n<p>I will guard King Ya’s church from unbelievers during the dominance of unbelieving Tǝloma’s children.</p>\n\n<p>Because of my church, which I guard, and because of the church buildings of angel Gabriel, he will make peace with the king. The king will compassionately appoint the local ruler of Shäwa to the town of his [the local ruler of Shäwa] ancestors.</p>\n\n<p>Then, the angel said to the king, I will come back and tell you the rest.</p>\n\n<p>The angel disappeared from King Lǝbnä Dǝngǝl.</p>\n\n<p>May her prayer and blessings be with us forever and ever. Amen.</p>"
      }
    ]
